@Demo.Saga.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5108

### 全部成功（返回 201，trip.Status = Completed）
POST {{Demo.Saga.Api_HostAddress}}/api/trips
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "destination": "东京",
  "traveler": "张三"
}

### 租车失败（返回 409，Compensated：机票与酒店已逆序补偿）
POST {{Demo.Saga.Api_HostAddress}}/api/trips?failCar=true
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "destination": "东京"
}

### 第一步失败（返回 409，Failed 且无可补偿：订酒店、租车均为 Skipped）
POST {{Demo.Saga.Api_HostAddress}}/api/trips?failFlight=true
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "destination": "东京"
}

### 行程列表（按创建时间倒序）
GET {{Demo.Saga.Api_HostAddress}}/api/trips
Accept: application/json

### 行程详情（把 <id> 替换为创建时返回的 Trip Id，查看每步状态与明细）
GET {{Demo.Saga.Api_HostAddress}}/api/trips/<id>
Accept: application/json

### destination 为空（返回 400）
POST {{Demo.Saga.Api_HostAddress}}/api/trips
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "destination": ""
}

###
GET {{Demo.Saga.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json
